{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":503704,"name":"TG Promo","username":"TG_Promo","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/t/f05b48/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-29T19:49:13.552Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBug in Grok Bot / Sand GenerateImage path.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GenerateImage tool schema accepts aspect_ratio (1:1, 4:3, 3:4, 16:9, 9:16). The tool parses the per-call value and passes it as the 5th argument into generateImageService. But createSandGenerateImageService is declared with only 4 parameters (_ctx, description, _filePath, referenceImages) and never forwards aspect_ratio into createSandImageGenerator / RunGenerateImageRequest.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResult: every generation comes back as JPEG 1280×720 (16:9), even when the agent requests 9:16, 3:4, or 1:1. Files are saved with a .png name but are JFIF/JPEG bytes. C2PA metadata identifies the producer as “Grok Imagine”.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe need true vertical 720×1280 (9:16) for social punch images. Prompt wording and retries do not fix this. Please forward aspect_ratio through createSandGenerateImageService into the cloud RPC.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRepro:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCall GenerateImage with aspect_ratio: “9:16” (also tried “1:1” and “3:4”).\u003cbr\u003e\nInspect output with ffprobe / file magic.\u003cbr\u003e\nObserve width×height always 1280×720, JPEG magic FF D8, C2PA agent “Grok Imagine”.\u003cbr\u003e\nRelated: Cursor has previously tracked fixed-resolution / dropped aspect issues for image generation. This Sand agent path still drops the ratio locally before the request leaves the box.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Grok Bot, ask the agent to call GenerateImage with aspect_ratio: “9:16” (also try “1:1” and “3:4”).\u003cbr\u003e\nOpen the saved asset and inspect with ffprobe / file magic.\u003cbr\u003e\nObserve width×height is always 1280×720, JPEG magic FF D8, C2PA producer “Grok Imagine”, even though the file name ends in .png.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot (Sand) — GenerateImage via createSandGenerateImageService\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot agent (GenerateImage → Grok Imagine backend)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo client Request ID exposed in Grok Bot chat UI for this tool call.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-additional-information-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-additional-information-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoot cause found in local sand-host: createGenerateImageTool passes aspect_ratio as 5th arg, but createSandGenerateImageService ignores it and never sets aspectRatio on RunGenerateImageRequest. Blocks true 720×1280 vertical social creatives.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-503704-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-503704-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T05:41:06.121Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":8,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":40.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":173363,"topic_slug":"generateimage-accepts-aspect-ratio-but-sand-drops-it-always-returns-1280x720-jpeg","display_username":"TG Promo","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":140293,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/generateimage-accepts-aspect-ratio-but-sand-drops-it-always-returns-1280x720-jpeg/173363/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":503867,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T05:40:46.681Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, thanks for the detailed report and for taking the debugging all the way to the service layer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a known issue we’re tracking. When generating images, Grok Bot currently drops the requested aspect ratio before sending the request, so the image always comes back in the default landscape size 1280x720, even if 9:16, 3:4, or 1:1 was requested. I’ve added your report to that issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe mismatch between the .png extension and the actual JPEG bytes is a separate thing, and it’s being tracked independently.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRight now there isn’t a reliable way to get a true vertical 720x1280 9:16 image from Grok Bot. The only temporary workaround is to crop the landscape output to the format you need. I can’t share an ETA for a fix yet, but I’ll post an update in this thread when there’s news.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T05:40:46.681Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":15.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":173363,"topic_slug":"generateimage-accepts-aspect-ratio-but-sand-drops-it-always-returns-1280x720-jpeg","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":